tart chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"That's probably true."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Especially with Eli."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"She doesn't say much unless she feels she has something useful to add."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Although sometimes what she thinks is useful is a five-paragraph explanation of something nobody asked about."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"😂"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"But yeah."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I think you two might get along."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Eli's usually better with technical things than the rest of us."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Which isn't saying much in my case."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I once m